    The mark itself is the source artwork, unaltered. Only its seating changed: it sits on the
    same squircle every other home-screen tile uses, because a circular or bare icon in a grid of
    squircles reads as a rendering fault rather than as a brand.

    See HomeApp.imageRes: a tile with artwork gets no coloured background drawn behind it.
-->
